# Steel Phantom (Bullet-Hell Action Platformer Game)
This is a Unity-based game developed for DIG2632 in the University of Florida.
The game focoses on fast character movements and bullet-hell shooter gameplay.

My contribution to key features
- Implemented player double jump, and grappling mechanic to achieve satisying character movements
- Implemented enemy pathfinding and patrol system
- Built a wave based enemy spawn system using conditions

Technologies used
- Unity
- C# (Visual Studio)

How to run
Download the build via itch.io 
https://jababoy1023.itch.io/steel-fantom

Some base scripts were provided by the instructor.
